  "prefLabel": "Puc 505.01 Meter Installations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 505.01 Meter Installations.\n\n(a) No gas utility in this state shall provide gas service to any master meter system constructed after July 1, 2013, without written approval from the commission. The commission shall approve such service only if the associated rates and charges for such service are found to be just and reasonable pursuant to RSA 378.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Puc 500) #13794, eff 10-25-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc500.html"
}
